@startuml 05-static-registration
!theme plain
title 5. 静态注册时机：为什么必须在第一次 poll() 之前\n注册是数据 TU 里的静态初始化器，由 runtime loader 在 main() 之前执行

== before main() — dynamic-loader phase ==

participant "game-world TU\nsrc/monster/data/\npart_schemas_data.cpp" as WTU
participant "RegisterWorldTablesAtStartup\nanonymous-namespace object :1011-1012\ndefined AFTER every table it hands over" as WOBJ #BBF7D0
participant "registerWorldTables() :1000" as WFN #FDE68A

participant "game-rise TU\nsrc/rise/part_schemas.cpp" as RTU
participant "RegisterRiseTablesAtStartup\nanonymous-namespace object :131-132\ndefined AFTER every table it hands over" as ROBJ #BBF7D0
participant "registerRiseTables() :118" as RFN #FDE68A

participant "core registry slots\nTables world; Tables rise;\ngame_tables.cpp:33-34\nhasCrowns / hasCapture / hasAilments set true,\npointers stored" as CORE #BFDBFE

== main() and each tick ==

participant "main.cpp:392\ncreateReader(gameId, explicitMap, dataDirs)" as M1
participant "reader ctor\nMhwReader :132 / MhrReader :166\nno register* call here\n(measured: grep = 0 hits)" as M2
participant "first reader->poll()\nmain.cpp:478" as M3
participant "first crown / ailment query\npanel_monster.cpp:1125 etc." as M4

== tests (no reader, no qrc) ==
participant "test init calls registerWorldTables() /\nregisterRiseTables() explicitly\nrise_monster_metadata_tests.cpp:35-36\nrise_monster_name_tests.cpp:59-60\nailment_style_tests.cpp:43-44" as X1 #F3F4F6

WTU -> WOBJ : static object ctor
WOBJ -> WFN : ctor body
WFN -> CORE : pointer handover\nregisterCrownThresholds(World, kCrownThresholds)\nregisterCaptureRules(World, &kMonsterCaptureThresholds, kNoNotCapturable())\nregisterAilmentStyles(World, kWorldAilmentStyles)

RTU -> ROBJ : static object ctor
ROBJ -> RFN : ctor body
RFN -> CORE : pointer handover\nregisterCrownThresholds(Rise, kRiseCrownThresholds)\nregisterCaptureRules(Rise, nullptr, kRiseNotCapturableMonsterIds)\nregisterAilmentStyles(Rise, kRiseAilmentStyles)

CORE --> M1 : already populated
M1 -> M2 : constructs
M2 -> M3
M3 -> M4

X1 -> CORE : registers both games' rows

note over CORE
顺序约束（源码事实，不是推断）：
· 同一个 TU 内初始化器自上而下执行，所以静态对象写在所有表定义之后 ——
  ctor 里取地址时表已构造（part_schemas_data.cpp:1007 表 vs :1011 对象）
· 跨 TU 的顺序未指定，也不影响：注册表只存指针，任一顺序都得到同样的槽位内容
· 好处是显式的：edit-mode demo 面板不构造 reader，静态初始化照样把 World 数据注册进去
  （放进 reader 构造函数的话，crown 芯片会静默消失，all_monster.png 差 730 像素）
· 目标文件侧确认：nm -C build/libgame-world.a 有 mhw::registerWorldTables()，
  libgame-rise.a 有 mhw::registerRiseTables()；两者都在各自的静态 init 里被调用
end note

@enduml
